  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterTutor2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "You\u2019re red all over. What happened?"
  - "\u2026\u2026"
  - "You keep making that face\u2026 What are you staring at?"
  - "Huh? What?.. Oh\u2026 I just\u2026 I really hate gear rooms. They\u2019re always
    dusty\u2026 and my blood vessels hurt\u2026"
  - "The first time they shoved me into a \u201Cmilitary\u201D locker room after
    one of my first missions\u2026"
  - "I almost passed out because of the helmet. It was stuffy. I can\u2019t stand
    stuffy rooms."
  - "Yeah, that happens. And looking at you, I get the impression a vest could knock
    you over. And\u2014"
  - "That\u2019s because you\u2019re fat."
  - "I\u2019m not fat."
  - But yeah, I do need to lose some weight.
  - "And I wasn\u2019t finished. I don\u2019t think you\u2019re dizzy from the gear
    this time. You work from an office now, after all."
  - "And what\u2019s that supposed to mean?"
  - "It means you\u2019re watching a sporty Asian guy changing clothes with a look
    like you\u2019re barely conscious."
  - What?
  - "Ew\u2014 no."
  - "Ask my brother. He\u2019ll tell you my face is always \u201Cdumb-looking.\u201D"
